window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Immortality sucks. You know what sucks more? Mortality.</p> <p>Imogen's on the verge of getting everything she ever wanted. The man of her dreams, a talented, smart kid who loves her, some amazing friends, she's finally safe from the ancient creature who keeps ripping her to pieces every time she tries to access her deeper powers—and she's only one step away from finding the reincarnation of her dad. Mortality is in her grasp.</p> <p>What more could she want? How about a little self-sabotage? A teenage stalker? A homicidal naiad? Maybe a demon-infested evil book club?</p> <p>Yeah. Immortality sucks.</p>"; 
